# Call recordings and their CSVs.  Every 30-call batch is ~200 MB of raw
# audio and the analysis scripts regenerate every number from it, so the
# repository keeps the instruments and not the readings.  Copy a batch out
# by hand if a finding needs to cite the audio itself.
captures/
# ...but records/ IS tracked: pre-registrations, scored results and discard
# notices are the provenance of a finding, not a reading, and two tracked
# scripts already cited a file in here that no clone ever received.  See
# records/README.md.  Captures worth keeping go to the ZFS store via
# archive.py, whose index is mirrored into records/ so the tree knows what is
# in the store without mounting it.

# Built from v8analyse.c, which is tracked.
v8analyse

__pycache__/
*.pyc
